{#
  Renders from content/geo/* (docs/CONTENT_MODEL.md) instead of the legacy
  {% include "tracks/geo.html" %} — thirteenth track cut over, following the established pattern
  (docs/DECISIONS/0005-qudrat-cutover.md through 0011). index.html's geo-* sections and
  src/_includes/tracks/geo.html are UNCHANGED and no longer read by this page, kept as the
  rollback path. build.js's MIGRATED_TRACKS set skips regenerating this file.

  Notes (WP25): simplest track shape since precalc — NO chapterTag anywhere, NO in-chapter
  practice-problem block of any kind, worked examples use the PLAIN 'example' callout style
  (<span class="xt">, not workedExampleCard's .fcard or ibsl/ibhl's example-grid). practiceSet is
  fully 'standard' (50 items, real class↔difficulty mapping matches the b/i/a default exactly, no
  levelLabel needed) — extracted via a regex script against source (50 items), not hand-transcribed.

  Two real deviations found nowhere else in the 21 tracks so far, both additive:
  - testGenerator.hasFullExam:false — geo's real source has ONLY the mini practice-test controls,
    no "Full official exam paper" section/button at all (course_schema.json's testGenerator
    definition, docs/DECISIONS/0012).
  - explorerBlock.readouts[].parts and cards[].wide — geo-right's Pythagoras explorer has one
    readout row ("a² + b²") whose <span class="v"> holds TWO separately-updating ids, not one
    (confirmed via search: this exact shape occurs nowhere else across all 21 tracks); geo-transform's
    formula-cards row has one 'wide' card among otherwise-plain siblings. docs/DECISIONS/0012.
  - explorerBlock.controls[].valueDisplayId is now optional — 2 of geo's 3 explorers show no live
    value next to their slider label at all (only the derived readouts update).

  subject-head's real <span class="eyebrow"> is genuinely empty (no eyebrowClass either) — omitted
  the pageHeader.eyebrow field entirely rather than passing an empty string. courseMeta stats say
  "Chapters · 8" though there are 11 numbered chapters — a real pre-existing source inaccuracy,
  preserved as-is (same call as tahsili's WP9 finding, not silently corrected).
#}
{% set geo = migratedContent.geo %}
{% set pageHeader = geo.meta.meta.pageHeader %}
<main id="view-geo" class="view">
  {% include "partials/subject-head.njk" %}

  <div class="wrap calc-body">
    {% set chapters = geo.chapters %}
    {% set practiceSetId = 'geo-practice' %}
    {% set testGeneratorId = 'geo-testgen' %}
    {% set downloadsId = 'geo-downloads' %}
    {% include "partials/rail.njk" %}

    <div class="content">
      {% for chapter in geo.chapters %}
        {% include "partials/chapter.njk" %}
      {% endfor %}

      {% set sectionId = 'geo-practice' %}
      {% set practiceSet = geo.practiceSet %}
      {% include "partials/practice-set.njk" %}

      {% set sectionId = 'geo-testgen' %}
      {% set testGenerator = geo.meta.meta.testGenerator %}
      {% include "partials/test-generator.njk" %}

      {% set sectionId = 'geo-downloads' %}
      {% set courseMeta = geo.meta.meta %}
      {% include "partials/downloads-block.njk" %}
    </div>
  </div>
</main>
